{"id":"980052349c9e74e5","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-formula-graph-expansion.md","title":"Hygienic Formula Templates and Graph Expansion","display":"df-formula-graph-expansion — Hygienic Formula Templates and Graph Expansion","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-formula-graph-expansion","aliases":["89-df-formula-graph-expansion"],"display":"df-formula-graph-expansion — Hygienic Formula Templates and Graph Expansion","depends_on":["[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","[[89-df-function]]"],"created":"2026-10-09","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-formula-graph-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-formula-graph-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-formula-graph-expansion — Hygienic Formula Templates and Graph Expansion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ec3012ebbfa291bf\" href=\"?note=ec3012ebbfa291bf\" title=\"89-df-first-order-formula\">89-df-first-order-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0d71e87a2f416230\" href=\"?note=0d71e87a2f416230\" title=\"89-df-function\">89-df-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-09"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\">\\(\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)\\)</span> 是已有一阶签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf V\">\\(\\mathsf V\\)</span> 是变量集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D=\\langle d_0,\\ldots,d_{r-1}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal D=\\langle d_0,\\ldots,d_{r-1}\\rangle\\)</span> 是有限有序声明表。关系声明为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)\\)</span>，函数图声明为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 的项及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 互异，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}(A)\\)</span> 包含于显示的参数列。名称包括种类和元数，不同声明不得使用同一个有类型名称。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个声明的右端是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 加前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 个声明名称构成的有限语法树。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rel},\\mathsf{Fun}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rel},\\mathsf{Fun}\\)</span> 是元层互异带标签构造子，不是对象符号。函数图声明的适用域由调用者显式给出；在适用域上存在唯一输出。未满足域条件时，只允许把图公式作为关系使用，不断言存在图值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)\\)</span> 是带参数列的公式模板。实例化使用已有的同时避免捕获替换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{AV}\">\\(\\mathsf{AV}\\)</span> 在含缩写的有限语法树上仍是全部变量叶及量词变量的并集；常元的变量集为空，函数与关系应用取各参数变量集的并集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec t\">\\(\\vec t\\)</span> 为项序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 是含输入全部变量的有限变量集。所有子式作用域外的变量均加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>；新变量列取已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fresh}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fresh}\\)</span>。只有非原始语言表达式使用展开条款；原始公式、原始项的恒等条款优先。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\vec u\">\\(\\exists\\vec u\\)</span> 为已有一阶有限折叠。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^+\">\\(C^+\\)</span> 是本次扩展签名的常元集，包括在声明表中按零元函数图登记的常元。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Ex}\">\\(\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Ex}\\)</span> 中是已经展开成纯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> 模板的有限表。新增图消去文件的有限合取、析取使用下式本地折叠；不覆盖 PA 程序图文件或 Solovay 文件另行指定的空项和初始项约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}graph\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\vec x:=\\vec t],\\\\\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\quad\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec x,\\quad\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A),B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A),B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,B),\\\\\n\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_0(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_{j+1}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)\\frown\n\\left\\langle\\mathsf{reb}\\left(d_j,\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j);\\mathsf{AV}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j)))\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq z=t\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(c,z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_c^{\\mathcal E};\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(c\\in C^+\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t\\frown\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(f\\notin F,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land C_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U\\cup\\{z\\},k)),\\\\\nC_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z=f(\\vec u),&amp;f\\in F,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u\\frown\\langle z\\rangle),&amp;f\\notin F,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(t=u;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists z\\exists w\\left(\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(u,w;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land z=w\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}(t=u\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ \\langle z,w\\rangle=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,2)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t)\n\\quad(R\\notin P,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\n\\land B_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k)),\\\\\nB_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R(\\vec u),&amp;R\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u),&amp;R\\notin P,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\neg A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A\\lor B;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)\\lor\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(B;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\forall x A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_{|\\mathcal D|}(\\mathcal D)}(A;\\mathsf{AV}(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\ \\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)=A.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}graph\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle;\\vec t)&amp;\\coloneqq A[\\vec x:=\\vec t],\\\\\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq R,\\quad\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq\\vec x,\\quad\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A),B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A),B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,B),\\\\\n\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E}&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_0(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_{j+1}(\\mathcal D)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)\\frown\n\\left\\langle\\mathsf{reb}\\left(d_j,\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j);\\mathsf{AV}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j)))\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq z=t\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(c,z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_c^{\\mathcal E};\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(c\\in C^+\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t\\frown\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(f\\notin F,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land C_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U\\cup\\{z\\},k)),\\\\\nC_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z=f(\\vec u),&amp;f\\in F,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u\\frown\\langle z\\rangle),&amp;f\\notin F,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq A\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(t=u;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists z\\exists w\\left(\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(u,w;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land z=w\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15mm}(t=u\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ \\langle z,w\\rangle=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,2)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t)\n\\quad(R\\notin P,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\n\\land B_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k)),\\\\\nB_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R(\\vec u),&amp;R\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u),&amp;R\\notin P,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\neg A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A\\lor B;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)\\lor\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(B;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\forall x A;U)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_{|\\mathcal D|}(\\mathcal D)}(A;\\mathsf{AV}(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\ \\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)=A.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\land A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\lor A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}A_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}A_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\land A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\lor A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i&lt;k}A_i&amp;\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i&lt;k}A_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i&lt;k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>声明表的每一右端先在更短声明表中展开，随后才允许调用，因此没有循环定义。已有纯语言公式保持原语法树；实例化只在避免捕获所必需时改名。函数图消去不把有定义域限制的操作变成无条件全函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-first-order-formula","status":"resolved","id":"ec3012ebbfa291bf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"0d71e87a2f416230","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L=(C,F,a_F,P,a_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D=\\langle d_0,\\ldots,d_{r-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Rel},\\mathsf{Fun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{AV}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec t","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fresh}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists\\vec u","display":false},{"tex":"C^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Val},\\mathsf{Ex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}formula\\text{-}graph\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\langle\\vec x,A\\rangle;\\vec t)&\\coloneqq A[\\vec x:=\\vec t],\\\\\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&\\coloneqq R,\\quad\n\\mathsf{name}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq f,\\\\\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&\\coloneqq\\vec x,\\quad\n\\mathsf{par}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A))&\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{body}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A))\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A),B)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,B),\\quad\n\\mathsf{reb}(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A),B)\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,B),\\\\\n\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Rel}(R,\\vec x,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E}&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Tpl}_{\\vec x\\frown\\langle y\\rangle}(A)\n\\quad(\\mathsf{Fun}(f,\\vec x,y,A)\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal E)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_0(\\mathcal D)&\\coloneqq\\langle\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Flat}_{j+1}(\\mathcal D)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)\\frown\n\\left\\langle\\mathsf{reb}\\left(d_j,\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_j(\\mathcal D)}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j);\\mathsf{AV}(\\mathsf{body}(d_j)))\\right)\\right\\rangle,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U)&\\coloneqq z=t\n\\quad(t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(c,z;U)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_c^{\\mathcal E};\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(c\\in C^+\\setminus C),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t\\frown\\langle z\\rangle)\n\\quad(f\\notin F,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(f(\\vec t),z;U)&\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u)\\cup\\{z\\})\n\\land C_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U\\cup\\{z\\},k)),\\\\\nC_f^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u,z)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}z=f(\\vec u),&f\\in F,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Gamma_f^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u\\frown\\langle z\\rangle),&f\\notin F,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)&\\coloneqq A\\quad(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(t=u;U)&\\coloneqq\n\\exists z\\exists w\\left(\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t,z;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land\n\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(u,w;U\\cup\\{z,w\\})\\land z=w\\right)\\\\\n&\\hspace{15mm}(t=u\\notin\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\ \\langle z,w\\rangle=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,2)),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec t)\n\\quad(R\\notin P,\\ k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(R(\\vec t);U)&\\coloneqq\n\\exists\\vec u\\left(\\bigwedge_{i<k}\\mathsf{Val}_{\\mathcal E}(t_i,u_i;U\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec u))\n\\land B_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)\\right)\n\\quad(k=|\\vec t|,\\ \\vec t\\notin\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\mathcal L)^k,\\ \\vec u=\\mathsf{Fresh}(U,k)),\\\\\nB_R^{\\mathcal E}(\\vec u)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}R(\\vec u),&R\\in P,\\\\\n\\mathsf{App}(\\Delta_R^{\\mathcal E};\\vec u),&R\\notin P,\\end{cases}\n,\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\neg A;U)&\\coloneqq\\neg\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A\\lor B;U)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U)\\lor\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(B;U),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(\\forall x A;U)&\\coloneqq\\forall x\\,\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathcal E}(A;U\\cup\\{x\\}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)&\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Ex}_{\\mathsf{Flat}_{|\\mathcal D|}(\\mathcal D)}(A;\\mathsf{AV}(A)),\\\\\n&\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L),\\quad\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A))\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(A),\\\\\n&\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\ \\mathsf{Expand}_{\\mathcal D}(A)=A.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\neg\\forall v_0(v_0=v_0),\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)&\\coloneqq A,\\quad\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A\\rangle)\\coloneqq A,\\\\\n\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\land A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s\\frown\\langle A\\rangle)&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(s)\\lor A\\quad(|s|\\ge1),\\\\\n\\bigwedge_{i<k}A_i&\\coloneqq\\mathsf{And}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i<k\\rangle),\\quad\n\\bigvee_{i<k}A_i\\coloneqq\\mathsf{Or}_{\\mathcal L}(\\langle A_i\\mid i<k\\rangle).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":6999,"backlinks":[{"id":"d773e54334af93ea","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]]：有参数模板、避免捕获实例化及函数图消去。"},{"id":"76cab88fafa3b379","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1076c7ed1730eab7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\forall x\\in a\\,A$、$\\exists x\\in a\\,A$ 和 $x\\subseteq y$ 采用下列消去规则。所有公式模板按下列声明图的有限依赖闭包登记；图值调用使用 [[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]] 的 $\\mathsf{Expand}$。函数图的输入域由图公式自身及调用位置给出，不在无定义输入上把函数项当作存在的对象。"},{"id":"580b00b43dcd196a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-first-order-formula]] → [[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-graph-notation]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-language]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-coded-syntax]] → [[89-lem-settheoretic-coded-syntax]] → [[89-df-settheoretic-models]]。"}],"outgoing":["ec3012ebbfa291bf","0d71e87a2f416230"]}